page's description under the navigation's title ("Services beside your
mail: issue trackers, calendars, CRM and AI"), the group Connected Services
(integrations_group) with every account that is not a mail account
(AccountListSection: its description, the rows — an AI provider account's
with its "API key" capsule and today's tokens — and the empty row
integrations_empty_row, "No integrations yet", "Add one from the list
below", shown only while there is no row at all), then without a heading
of their own the local AI integrations that are connected (Claude Desktop,
Claude Code and ChatGPT (Codex), state of this client rather than accounts
